OL,3,AUS inmate Christa Pike says she woke up
OL,4,A'confused and in pain' after failed
OL,5,Aexecution
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS death row inmate Christa Pike has
OL,8,Freleased her first public statement
OL,9,Fsince her botched execution in
OL,10,FSeptember.
OL,12,F"There hasn't been a moment since that
OL,13,Fnight when I haven't been in pain," she
OL,14,Fsaid in the statement.
OL,16,F"My body hurts. My arms hurt. My hands
OL,17,Fhurt. My throat hurts. I still struggle
OL,18,Fto speak. And the pain isn't just
OL,19,Fphysical. There is pain in my mind and
OL,20,Fin my soul."
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
